<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>The agency, with respect to any disclosure containing information about which the individual has filed a statement of disagreement, shall clearly note any portion of the record which is disputed and make available copies of such individual’s statement and copies of a concise statement of the reasons of the agency for not making the amendment to any person or agency to whom the disputed record has been or is disclosed.</p></caml:Content>